GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello
### 创建用户 Tom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "tom",
  "nickname": "Tom"
}
### 创建用户 Alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "alice",
  "nickname": "Alice"
}
### 查询全部用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Day4 - 空用户名测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "nickname": "Test"
}

### ================================================
### FlashLife Day4
### Validation + Exception Handling
### ================================================
### 1. 正常创建 Alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "nickname": "Alice"
}
### 2. username 为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "nickname": "Test"
}
### 3. username 太短
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "nickname": "Test"
}
### 4. username 含非法字符
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hello@world",
  "nickname": "Test"
}
### 5. nickname 为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new_user",
  "nickname": ""
}
### 6. 创建已经存在的 tom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tom",
  "nickname": "Another Tom"
}
### 7. 查询存在的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
### 8. 查询不存在用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/9999
### 9. 查询全部用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
### 10. 查询用户数量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/count

### ==================================================
### FlashLife Day5
### Register + BCrypt + Login
### ==================================================


### 1. 注册 alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "Alice123456",
  "nickname": "Alice"
}


### 2. 注册 tom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tom",
  "password": "Tom123456",
  "nickname": "Tom"
}


### 3. 重复注册 alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "AnotherPassword123",
  "nickname": "Alice2"
}


### 4. 正确密码登录 alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "Alice123456"
}


### 5. 错误密码登录 alice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}


### 6. 不存在用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "not_exist",
  "password": "Whatever123"
}


### 7. 查询用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users


### 8. 查询 alice
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1


### 9. 用户数量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/count

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/mee

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "Alice123456"
}
###
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
### ================================================
### 1. 注册
### ================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jack",
  "password": "Jack123456",
  "nickname": "Jack"
}


### ================================================
### 2. 登录
### ================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "Alice123456"
}


### ================================================
### 3. 未登录访问当前用户
### 应该：401
### ================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me


### ================================================
### 4. 带 JWT 查询当前用户
### 应该：200
### ================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================
### 5. 带 JWT 查询用户列表
### ================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================
### 6. 带 JWT 查询用户数量
### ================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}